            String guidelines = "• Check Card Plastic for any abnormalities. Verify for Visa/Master/Maestro/Rupay/Amex/Diners/Discover etc.. emblem Logo, pre-printed bank name & validity of the card before the transactions.\n" + "• For transactions exceeding Rs. 50,000, PAN Card copy of the customer is mandatory.\n" + "• Make sure the QR code is easy to find for customers, instructions for usage are displayed, and it is placed within the business premises to prevent tampering.\n" + "• Make an invoice with all Terms & Conditions printed and get the invoice & Charge slip signed by the Customer for all transactions and retain the merchant copy. Verify, collect & retain the Customer documents for all transactions.\n" + "• Submit the required documents to Bijlipay upon request whenever the amount is withheld in risk triggers so as to enable/release such withheld payments.\n" + "• Notify us of the changes in your Business model, Mode of Ownership, or Business registered address, if any, for the smooth functioning of the business.\n" + "• Do communicate with us immediately if you are changing your Email ID, Mobile number, or Bank account details for uninterrupted services & hassle-free settlements.\n" + "• Return the payment acceptance device/QR to Bijlipay office immediately upon discontinuation of the Merchant agreement.\n" + "• Ensure that the transaction is complete/successful before rendering the services to the customer.\n";

