            String restrictions = "• Do not process your own credit/debit cards on your own payment acceptance device/QR.\n" + "• Do not accept white plastic cards without the logo of the bank, MasterCard, Visa, Maestro, Rupay, or Amex/Diners/Discover etc...\n" + "• Do not accept QR stickers, code kits, or standees from unauthorized sources. Do not stick the QR on walls or open spaces. Use QR codes only for the business declared with Bijlipay.\n" + "• Do not split the amount or encourage multiple swipes for a single transaction.\n" + "• Do not accept sensitive  card information via email, phone, or other electronic formats (e.g., chat windows).\n" + "• Do not process the refund of a transaction through any of the following modes: cash, cheque, online transfer, NEFT, or RTGS.\n" + "• Refunds should be processed only to the card used for the purchase through the aggregator. Any violation of this may lead to disputes.\n" + "• Do not hand over your payment acceptance device/QR for anyone else to use.\n" + "• Do not provide cash against credit, debit, prepaid, or gift cards unless registered specifically to provide such services.\n" + "• Do not charge the customer MDR/service charge for using the card for payment.\n";

