                String content27 = "In reference to RBI circular RBI/2017-18/105 DPSS.CO.PD No.1633/02.14.003/2017-18, titled" + "“Rationalisation of Merchant Discount Rate (MDR) For Debit Card Transactions”, financial institutes" + "such as Bijlipay are permitted to levy lower Merchant Discount Rate (“MDR”) on Debit Card" + "Transactions of small merchant (Merchant with turnover up to INR 20,00,000/- (Indian Rupees Twenty" + "Lakhs only) during the previous financial year (hereinafter “RBI Circular”).\n\n";
